# ==============================================================================
# DODO UNIVERSE - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE (PURE SUPABASE BAAS)
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to .env for local reference.
# NEVER commit .env or files with real keys/passwords to version control.
